      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-10-21_WidnesExaminer_art0087" n="art0087">
        <head>Royal Court Theatre</head>
        <p>Royal Court Theatre</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON.</p>
        <p>Next Week Twice Nightly, 6.45 &amp; 8.45 MATINEES MONDAY &amp; THURSDAY, 2.45.</p>
