        <p>At Walkden. Warrington Town: Kite; Leah, Millward; Stephens, Whitfield, Ditchfield; Deakin, Siddall, Aspinall, Woodhouse and Banner. The train will leave Warrington Central Station at 12.55. Two pf the team, Deakin and Woodhouse, are local juniors.</p>
