        <p>LATCHFORD CADETS V. WIDNES ST. MARY'S. At Widnes. Latchford Cadets: Miller; Jones, Williams; TIT vor, Gibson, Porter; Davenport, Bradshaw, Plumb, Massey and Mayers. Reserves: Cartwright and Players meet at Bridge Foot at 1.45 p.m.</p>
